   "parts": [
    [
     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><pre style=\"font-family:&quot;Lucida Console&quot;;font-size:10pt!important;outline:currentcolor none medium;border:medium none;word-break:break-all;margin:0px;white-space:pre-wrap!important;line-height:15px;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:normal;letter-spacing:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;word-spacing:0px;background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><span><span style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif\"><br>Hi again,<br><br>Tangentially related to <a href=\"https://groups.google.com/forum/#!topic/r-inla-discussion-group/_e2C2L7Wc30\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://groups.google.com/forum/%23!topic/r-inla-discussion-group/_e2C2L7Wc30&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792442136134000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1nFsT4Zw74QlXeVVuTG-eH\">my last question about linear combinations of grouped random effects</a>, I get an error when trying to use inla.uncbind that indicates that inla.cbind isn&#39;t exported to the INLA namespace.<br><br>If I run the example<a href=\"http://www.r-inla.org/faq#TOC-I-have-some-linear-combinations-of-the-nodes-in-the-latent-field-that-I-want-to-compute-the-posterior-marginal-of-is-that-possible-\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://www.r-inla.org/faq%23TOC-I-have-some-linear-combinations-of-the-nodes-in-the-latent-field-that-I-want-to-compute-the-posterior-marginal-of-is-that-possible-&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792442136134000&amp;usg=AOvVaw3JfmcQaE1gyKQrqVTENAQD\"> here</a>:<br><span style=\"font-family:courier new,monospace\"><br></span></span></span></span></pre><div style=\"margin-left:40px\"><span style=\"font-family:courier new,monospace\">m = 10<br>wa = runif(m)<br>wb = runif(m)</span></div><div style=\"margin-left:40px\"><span style=\"font-family:courier new,monospace\"><br></span></div><div style=\"margin-left:40px\"><span style=\"font-family:courier new,monospace\">## if &#39;wa&#39; and &#39;wb&#39; is defined in a matrix, like<br><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">A = cbind(a=wa, b=wb)<br><br>## then we can define the same lincombs using inla.uncbind(),<br>lc.many = inla.make.lincombs( inla.uncbind(A) )</span></span></div><pre style=\"font-family:&quot;Lucida Console&quot;;font-size:10pt!important;outline:currentcolor none medium;border:medium none;word-break:break-all;margin:0px;white-space:pre-wrap!important;line-height:15px;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:normal;letter-spacing:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;word-spacing:0px;background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><span><span style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif\"></span></span><span><span style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif\"><br>I get <br></span></span></span></pre><div style=\"margin-left:40px\"><pre style=\"font-size:10pt!important;outline:currentcolor none medium;border:medium none;word-break:break-all;margin:0px;white-space:pre-wrap!important;line-height:15px;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:normal;letter-spacing:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;word-spacing:0px;background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><span style=\"font-family:courier new,monospace\"><span><span><span>Error in inla.uncbind(A) : could not find function &quot;inla.uncbind&quot;</span></span><br><br></span></span></span></pre></div><pre style=\"font-size:10pt!important;outline:currentcolor none medium;border:medium none;word-break:break-all;margin:0px;white-space:pre-wrap!important;line-height:15px;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:normal;letter-spacing:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;word-spacing:0px;background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\"><span style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><span>And explicitly calling INLA::inla.uncbind yields</span></span></span><br><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><span style=\"font-family:courier new,monospace\"><span></span></span></span></pre><div style=\"margin-left:40px\"><pre style=\"font-size:10pt!important;outline:currentcolor none medium;border:medium none;word-break:break-all;margin:0px;white-space:pre-wrap!important;line-height:15px;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:normal;letter-spacing:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;word-spacing:0px;background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\"><br><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><span style=\"font-family:courier new,monospace\"><span><span style=\"font-family:courier new,monospace\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">lc.many = inla.make.lincombs( inla.uncbind(A) )<br></span></span><br>Error: &#39;inla.uncbind&#39; is not an exported object from &#39;namespace:INLA&#39;</span></span></span></pre></div><pre style=\"font-family:&quot;Lucida Console&quot;;font-size:10pt!important;outline:currentcolor none medium;border:medium none;word-break:break-all;margin:0px;white-space:pre-wrap!important;line-height:15px;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:normal;letter-spacing:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;word-spacing:0px;background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><span></span><span>\r\n</span></span></pre><div><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><br></span></div><div><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">I see <a href=\"https://bitbucket.org/hrue/r-inla/src/c11a38115e38a849edae8adeb078a404b03840a8/rinla/R/lincomb.R?at=default&amp;fileviewer=file-view-default#lincomb.R-181\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://bitbucket.org/hrue/r-inla/src/c11a38115e38a849edae8adeb078a404b03840a8/rinla/R/lincomb.R?at%3Ddefault%26fileviewer%3Dfile-view-default%23lincomb.R-181&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792442136134000&amp;usg=AOvVaw0Zl9VHawAGhp2NOWlwX4z0\">inla.uncbind in the source</a>, but I&#39;m not sure why it isn&#39;t exported to the namespace.  I have no reason to think this issue is local to my machine, but one never knows.  <b>Any idea how to fix?</b></span></div><div><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><br></span></div><div><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">My workaround at the moment is <br></span></div><div style=\"margin-left:40px\"><br><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><span style=\"font-family:courier new,monospace\">lc1 &lt;- do.call(&#39;inla.make.lincombs&#39;, as.list( as.data.frame(A)) ) </span><br></span></span></div><div style=\"margin-left:40px\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><br></span></span></div><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">which produces the same output as</span></span><div style=\"margin-left:40px\"><br><span style=\"font-family:courier new,monospace\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">lc2 &lt;- inla.make.lincombs(a=wa,b=wb)</span></span></span></span></span></div><div><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"></span><br></div><br><div><pre style=\"font-family:&quot;Lucida Console&quot;;font-size:10pt!important;outline:currentcolor none medium;border:medium none;word-break:break-all;margin:0px;white-space:pre-wrap!important;line-height:15px;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:normal;letter-spacing:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;word-spacing:0px;background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><span><span style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif\">My session info:</span></span></span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><span><span style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif\"><span><span style=\"outline:none;border:none;word-break:break-all;margin:0px;white-space:pre-wrap!important\"><br></span></span></span></span></span></pre><div style=\"margin-left:40px\"><pre style=\"font-size:10pt!important;outline:currentcolor none medium;border:medium none;word-break:break-all;margin:0px;white-space:pre-wrap!important;line-height:15px;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:normal;letter-spacing:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;word-spacing:0px;background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\"><span style=\"font-family:courier new,monospace\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><span><span><span style=\"outline:none;border:none;word-break:break-all;margin:0px;white-space:pre-wrap!important\"></span></span></span></span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><span><span><span style=\"outline:none;border:none;word-break:break-all;margin:0px;white-space:pre-wrap!important\">R version 3.5.2 (2018-12-20) <br>Platform: x86_64-w64-mingw32/x64 (64-bit) <br>Running under: Windows &gt;= 8 x64 (build 9200) <br></span></span></span></span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">INLA version <span><span style=\"outline:none;border:none;word-break:break-all;margin:0px;white-space:pre-wrap!important\">18.07.12</span></span></span></span></pre></div><pre style=\"font-family:&quot;Lucida Console&quot;;font-size:10pt!important;outline:currentcolor none medium;border:medium none;word-break:break-all;margin:0px;white-space:pre-wrap!important;line-height:15px;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:normal;letter-spacing:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;word-spacing:0px;background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\"><br><span style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><span><span style=\"outline:none;border:none;word-break:break-all;margin:0px;white-space:pre-wrap!important\"></span></span></span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><span><span style=\"outline:none;border:none;word-break:break-all;margin:0px;white-space:pre-wrap!important\"></span></span></span></span></pre><pre style=\"font-family:&quot;Lucida Console&quot;;font-size:10pt!important;outline:currentcolor none medium;border:medium none;word-break:break-all;margin:0px;white-space:pre-wrap!important;line-height:15px;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:normal;letter-spacing:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;word-spacing:0px;background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><span><span style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif\">Thanks!<br><br>--Mike<br></span></span></span></pre><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"></span></div><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><span><span style=\"outline:none;border:none;word-break:break-all;margin:0px;white-space:pre-wrap!important\"></span></span><span><span style=\"outline:none;border:none;word-break:break-all;margin:0px;white-space:pre-wrap!important\"></span></span></span></div>"
